mount_changed` | Slider `onChangeEnd` | `amount`: `int` (`_amount.round()`) |","+| `terms_accepted` | Checkbox `onChanged`, only when it is ticked (not when unticked) | — |","+| `registration_continue_tapped` | Continue button, before navigating to `/offers` | `amount`: `int`, `terms`: `bool` |","+","+## Offers screen (`lib/screens/offer_screen.dart`)","+","+| Event | Where | Properties |","+|---|---|---|","+| `offers_scrolled` | `ScrollEndNotification` around the `ListView` | `offset`: `double` (`metrics.pixels`) |","+","+`OfferScreen` became a `StatefulWidget` so it can remember the deepest offset","+already sent.","+","+## Choices I made","+","+We are on the PostHog free tier, so I avoided sending an event on every","+keystroke or every frame:","+","+- **Started typing**: one event per field per screen visit, with flags","+  `_emailStarted` / `_phoneStarted`. It does not fire again if the user","+  clears the field and types again.","+- **Amount**: `onChangeEnd`, not `onChanged`. That gives one event per drag or","+  tap with the final value, instead of dozens per drag.","+- **Scroll**: sent when a scroll gesture ends, and only if the user got","+  further down than any offset already sent on this visit. Scrolling back up","+  sends nothing. `offset` is how far down they got.","+- **PII**: no email or phone values are sent. The \"started\" events have no","+  properties.","+","+If product wants different behaviour (for example, an event on every scroll","+end, or `terms_accepted` firing again after untick and re-tick), it's a","+one-line change in each place.","+","+## Checks","+","+- `dart format lib` and `flutter analyze` report no issues.","+- `flutter analyze` ran `pub get`, which created `.dart_tool/` and","+  `pubspec.lock` and changed `analysis_options.yaml`. I reverted and deleted","+  all of these so only the two screens and this file changed.","+- No tests exist in the project and I didn't add any. I didn't run the app on","+  a device, so nothing went to PostHog."]}],"created":true},{"filePath":"/private/tmp/h-4ls8kF/pubspec.lock","hunks":[{"oldStart":1,"oldLines":282,"newStart":0,"newLines":0,"lines":["-# Generated by pub","-# See https://dart.dev/tools/pub/glossary#lockfile","-packages:","-  async:","-    dependency: transitive","-    description:","-      name: async","-      sha256: e2eb0491ba5ddb6177742d2da23904574082139b07c1e33b8503b9f46f3e1a37","-      url: \"https://pub.dev\"","-    source: hosted","-    version: \"2.13.1\"","-  boolean_selector:","-    dependency: transitive","-    description:","-      name: boolean_selector","-      sha256: \"8aab1771e1243a5063b8b0ff68042d67334e3feab9e95b9490f9a6ebf73b42ea\"","-      url: \"https://pub.dev\"","-    source: hosted","-    version: \"2.1.2\"","-  characters:","-    dependency: transitive","-    description:","-      name: characters","-      sha256: faf38497bda5ead2a8c7615f4f7939df04333478bf32e4173fcb06d428b5716b","-      url: \"https://pub.dev\"","-    source: hosted","-    version: \"1.4.1\"","-  clock:","-    dependency: transitive","-    description:","-      name: clock","-      sha256: e51d50bca3217c9a9fa2b41a30e4a38971133f5f9ec7a3d57bae095007f1d28e","-      url: \"https://pub.dev\"","-    source: hosted","-    version: \"1.1.3\"","-  collection:","-    dependency: transitive","-    description:","-      name: collection","-      sha256: \"2f5709ae4d3d59dd8f7cd309b4e023046b57d8a6c82130785d2b0e5868084e76\"","-      url: \"https://pub.dev\"","-    source: hosted","-    version: \"1.19.1\"","-  fake_async:","-    dependency: transitive","-    description:","-      name: fake_async","-      sha256: \"5368f224a74523e8d2e7399ea1638b37aecfca824a3cc4dfdf77bf1fa905ac44\"","-      url: \"https://pub.dev\"","-    source: hosted","-    version: \"1.3.3\"","-  ffi:","-    dependency: transitive","-    description:","-      name: ffi","-      sha256: \"6d7fd89431262d8f3125e81b50d3847a091d846eafcd4fdb88dd06f36d705a45\"","-      url: \"https://pub.dev\"","-    sour