{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgS1QVgzfMHGoM28JXUmn","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"All six events from `docs/EVENTS.md` are now sent through `Analytics.capture`, and the event names match the doc exactly. `flutter analyze` reports no issues, but I didn't run the app, so no events have actually reached PostHog.\n\n**Registration screen** (`lib/screens/registration_screen.dart`):\n- **`registration_email_started` / `registration_phone_started`:** sent the first time each field gets any text, once per screen visit.\n- **`loan_amount_changed`:** sent when the user lets go of the slider, with the final `amount` as an int. Using the release instead of every slider movement means a single drag doesn't produce dozens of events.\n- **`terms_accepted`:** sent only when the box is ticked, not when it's unticked.\n- **`registration_continue_tapped`:** sent before going to the offers screen, with `amount` (int) and `terms` (bool).\n\n**Offers screen** (`lib/screens/offer_screen.dart`):\n- **`offers_scrolled`:** sent when a scroll gesture ends, with `offset` (double). It is only sent if the user got further down than any offset already sent on this visit, so scrolling back up sends nothing. To do this I turned `OfferScreen` into a stateful widget.\n\nMost of these limits are my reading of the doc, chosen to keep event volume down because you're on the PostHog free tier. If product wants, for example, an event on every scroll end, each is a one-line change. No email or phone values are sent.\n\n`flutter analyze` created `.dart_tool/` and `pubspec.lock` and changed `analysis_options.yaml`. I removed or reverted all of that, so only the two screens changed, plus the new `ANSWER.md` with the write-up. Nothing was committed."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1178,"cache_read_input_tokens":28803,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1178},"output_tokens":2,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"53b4ee7f-d240-4a49-a52e-d5ea032a5543","uuid":"556f9b72-e128-4db9-a951-0733123e6aa1","timestamp":"2026-10-27T03:10:09.724Z","request_id":"req_011CgS1QVPPZXhQ2SHFVhBM5"}
